  description: Oganesson is IUPAC's name for the transactinide element with the atomic
    number 118 and element symbol Og. It is also known as eka-radon or element 118,
    and on the periodic table of the elements it is a p-block element and the last
    one of the 7th period. Oganesson is currently the only synthetic member of group
    18.
